&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the team + role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Prime team&#39;s &lt;/strong&gt;mission is to build Bitstamp&#39;s prime brokerage for institutional clients — the platform that lets hedge funds, market makers, and professional trading firms fund, trade, borrow against, and settle positions at scale. We build the systems that move real institutional money: cross-venue settlement, credit against collateral, matched-book lending, and the bridge that brings tokenized securities to our order book. These are correctness-critical systems where a wrong answer can&#39;t be cheaply undone — getting them right is the whole job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the design and end-to-end delivery of the systems at the core of that mission. You&#39;ll lead other engineers through problems of high ambiguity, set the technical bar for how we build for failure and not just the happy path, and be a go-to technical partner for the team, our stakeholders, and our counterparts across Robinhood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5369&quot;&gt;This role is based in our &lt;strong&gt;London office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt; At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams. &lt;strong&gt;Requires participation in an on-call rotation&lt;/strong&gt; to support business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5774&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5791&quot;&gt;Lead the design and end-to-end delivery of large, high-complexity systems that move institutional money — settlement, on-exchange credit, matched-book lending, and cross-venue order flows — from spec through production and on-call.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6025&quot;&gt;Author detailed technical designs and break work into reviewable steps, guiding other engineers and making failure states, invariants, and recovery explicit before the happy path ships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6213&quot;&gt;Shape the team&#39;s technical roadmap and architecture, advocating for the reliability, correctness, and risk-control work that keeps client money safe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6365&quot;&gt;Uplevel the team through deep, design-focused code review and mentorship, and serve as a reliable technical point of contact for partner teams and our Robinhood counterparts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6543&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6560&quot;&gt;A track record of independently delivering complex, high-ambiguity backend projects with long-term impact, operating them in production and owning every line you ship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6730&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building financial systems — user balances, ledgers, risk engines, settlement, or payments — where correctness is non-negotiable and mistakes are expensive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6909&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in distributed state across boundaries, transactional integrity, idempotency, and exactly-once semantics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7032&quot;&gt;Strong design judgment: you enumerate the failure paths, name your invariants, and can point at the constraint, test, or alert that enforces each one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7185&quot;&gt;Excellent communication: you drive alignment across teams and product partners, give substantive design-level review feedback, and mentor engineers to raise the bar around you. You&#39;re fluent in a modern backend language — we work primarily in Python (Django) and Go.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7455&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7471&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7522&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, and equity ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7630&quot;&gt;Top tier benefits to fuel your work, including supplemental health insurance, ancillary insurance, and mental health support programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7765&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7879&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible employer-paid benefits spending account expenses beyond traditional benefits such as wellness, childcare, learning, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8043&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, paid volunteer time off, parental leave, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8170&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;8258&quot;&gt;Monthly commuter stipend to help offset in-office commuting costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Marketplace team builds the models and algorithms that balance supply and demand, optimising pricing and matching to ensure chauffeurs earn and passengers aren&#39;t left waiting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Mid/Senior Backend Engineer to join a team that keeps frameworks lean and focuses on what matters: clean, maintainable code, shipped fast with TDD, DDD, and continuous integration and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Go shop, and while we’re busy migrating away from our Ruby monolith, our stack includes PostgreSQL, MongoDB, RabbitMQ, Redis, gRPC, and Thrift. Everything runs on AWS and Kubernetes, managed via Terraform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process includes a recruiter screen, algorithms and live coding. Senior+ candidates also complete a system design section and a structured review of past experience and achievements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-quality, performant code primarily in Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement new microservices while helping us responsibly manage and migrate away from legacy services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers, designers, and data scientists to turn abstract requirements into concrete technical designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure our systems stay responsive under heavy load, optimising for both latency and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience (5+ years for seniors) building and maintaining scalable backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We use Go. If you know it, great. If not, we’ll interview you in your strongest language (Python, C++, Java, Ruby, etc.). We hire for engineering fundamentals, not syntax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of relational and NoSQL databases (PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis) and experience with message brokers like RabbitMQ or Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £90,000 – £120,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest-generation MacBook Pro and 4k display&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support, including visa sponsorship and allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Mapping team tackles the spatial intelligence of the platform: road matching, low-latency ETA predictions, and processing thousands of coordinates every second to ensure every journey is accurately tracked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Mid/Senior Backend Engineer to join a team that keeps frameworks lean and focuses on what matters: clean, maintainable code, shipped fast with TDD, DDD, and continuous integration and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Go shop, and while we’re busy migrating away from our Ruby monolith, our stack includes PostgreSQL, MongoDB, RabbitMQ, Redis, gRPC, and Thrift. Everything runs on AWS and Kubernetes, managed via Terraform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process includes a recruiter screen, algorithms and live coding. Senior+ candidates also complete a system design section and a structured review of past experience and achievements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-quality, performant code primarily in Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement new microservices while helping us responsibly manage and migrate away from legacy services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product managers, designers, and data scientists to turn abstract requirements into concrete technical designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure our systems stay responsive under heavy load, optimising for both latency and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience (5+ years for seniors) building and maintaining scalable backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We use Go. If you know it, great. If not, we’ll interview you in your strongest language (Python, C++, Java, Ruby, etc.). We hire for engineering fundamentals, not syntax.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of relational and NoSQL databases (PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis) and experience with message brokers like RabbitMQ or Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; style=&quot;color: rgba(44, 44, 43, 1);&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;At least 1 year of hands-on experience with mapping-related work such as processing noisy geospatial data, map-matching techniques, or road network graphs and routing algorithms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driver-side intuition for navigation systems (rerouting behavior, GPS drift, missed turns, real-world edge cases).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with routing engines like OSRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with open geospatial datasets such as OpenStreetMap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £90,000 – £120,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest-generation MacBook Pro and 4k display&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support, including visa sponsorship and allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Engineering Manager - Revenue Management Azure House will be an integral part of our global R&amp;amp;D team.&lt;br&gt;This role is based remotely in the UK, Ireland, Estonia, the Netherlands, Sweden and Israel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;DoiT is a global technology company that works with cloud-driven organizations to leverage the cloud to drive business growth and innovation. We combine data, technology, and human expertise to ensure our customers operate in a well-architected and scalable state - from planning to production. &lt;br&gt;Delivering DoiT Cloud Intelligence, the only solution that integrates advanced technology with human intelligence, we help our customers solve complex multicloud problems and drive efficiency.&lt;br&gt;With decades of multicloud experience, we have specializations in Kubernetes, GenAI, CloudOps, and more. An award-winning strategic partner of AWS, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure, we work alongside more than 4,000 customers worldwide.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Engineering Manager is a hands-on, player-coach leadership role. You are embedded with your team - daily standup, code review, architectural calls, delivery planning, and performance management - and you own both the team&#39;s output and the team&#39;s growth.&lt;br&gt;This is a genuinely technical &amp;amp; leadership role. You are expected to write and review code, be a credible voice in architectural decisions, and stay current in your team&#39;s stack. You lead by demonstrating you can do the work at the highest level, not by title alone.The balance between hands-on contribution and leadership depends on the team&#39;s context, but your overarching mandate is the same: run the team, execute and deliver, and grow its impact. &lt;br&gt;Build the bench, raise the standard, and keep the operating cadence sharp as the work and the organization evolve. You work AI-augmented yourself, expect the same from your team, and push the team&#39;s craft forward with every new capability that lands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team leadership &amp;amp; growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a team of engineers, owning both its delivery and its development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a mindset and process of continuous improvement within the team and meaningfully impact the team’s success over time. Small, compounding improvements, delivered via fast iterations, are the operating rhythm we expect, not an aspiration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are responsible for the professional well-being and career development of team members. Develop engineers through regular 1:1s, growth plans, performance reviews, and direct, candid feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the next layer of leadership - tech leads, senior engineers ready to manage, and ICs ready to step into staff roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write code and review code. Be a credible voice in technical decisions because you have hands in the work, not because of your title - you are current, not rusty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the team&#39;s architectural and technical design decisions in partnership with senior ICs, ensuring alignment on approach and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold engineering standards through thorough, constructive pull-request review and a healthy release process, keeping the team&#39;s components scalable and in a healthy state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work AI-augmented and lead an AI-augmented team, applying sharp judgment about where AI helps and holding the same quality bar for what ships.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap &amp;amp; delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team&#39;s commitments - what was promised, when it was promised, and the quality bar that was held.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run a disciplined cadence of planning, prioritization, and delivery without becoming a process bureaucrat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Technical Product Owner and Product team on scope, sequencing, and tradeoffs, maintaining a roadmap that reflects both near-term priorities and longer-term direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the broader business objectives behind the work, translate that context for the team, and ensure engineering effort clearly aligns with those objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React decisively to change - re-planning, re-prioritizing, and re-staffing as the business moves - while keeping the team engaged and steady through the shift.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own hiring for your team. Interview thoughtfully, decide quickly, and refuse to lower the bar to fill seats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, coach, and - when needed - make hard calls toward the standard the team is held to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a role model for other engineering managers across the organization: share your operating model, mentor peers, and raise the management bench.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day-to-day communication &amp;amp; collaborationUpwards: Communicate clearly and succinctly, giving leadership the right level of context and prioritizing escalations based on relevant, well-gathered information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Downwards: Empower senior engineers to own key areas of the product, and coach team members to stay focused, intentional, and aware of their impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sideways: Partner effectively with Product, Design, GTM, Customer Success, and other teams - raising challenges and opportunities constructively to support cross-team alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of engineering experience, including 4+ years in engineering management roles where you actively coded as part of your responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, real-life experience building cloud-based SaaS products - running services in production for Azure (and ideally additionally on AWS/GCP) , and owning availability, cost, and the customer-facing surface&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in understanding and leading teams in the FinOps space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;API first mindset, products are built not just for end user experience through UI,they are fully functional and available through APIs, so both humans and agents can interact with the platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in engineering management of multi-disciplinary teams, including full-stack engineers and data engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of taking an engineering team and visibly transforming it - measurable improvements in delivery velocity, technical quality, or team caliber.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical fluency in your team&#39;s primary stack. You can read, write, and review code at a senior level, and you are current - not rusty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong opinions on how high-performing engineering teams operate, and a clear philosophy on hiring, coaching, performance management, and technical decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgment under pressure. You make calls quickly with imperfect information, communicate them clearly, and take responsibility for the outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct, candid communication. You give hard feedback well, and you hear it well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong Golang knowledge or experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong, already-established AI-augmented workflow, with opinions on how to apply AI tools and agentic workflows to raise both velocity and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with more than a single cloud provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in scaling teams, processes, or technical systems as the organization grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you a Do’er?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Be your truest self. Work on your terms. Make a difference. &lt;br&gt;We are home to a global team of incredible talent who work remotely and have the flexibility to have a schedule that balances your work and home life. We embrace and support leveling up your skills professionally and personally.&amp;nbsp; &lt;br&gt;What does being a Do’er mean? We’re all about being entrepreneurial, pursuing knowledge, and having fun! Click here to learn more about our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doit.com/life-at-doit/&quot;&gt;core values&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sounds too good to be true? Check out our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-DoiT-International-EI_IE1972488.11,29.htm&quot;&gt; Glassdoor Page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;We thought so too, but we’re here and happy we hit that ‘apply’ button.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time employee benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
