&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Ping Identity &lt;strong&gt;Staff Site Reliability Engineer,&lt;/strong&gt; you will be involved in every facet of our Cloud-based services. You will establish solutions for building, deploying, and maintaining the infrastructure of one of the largest identity platforms in the world. We follow a DevOps model: Development and Operations teams are integrated, running continuous deployments daily, and the teams collaborate in the solution&#39;s development, deployment, and operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively and independently to design and deliver solutions as well as review and provide feedback for those delivered by other engineers for our software and services on our cloud hosted production infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how our mission-critical enterprise software solutions are developed and deployed using optimized and automated CI/CD pipelines that ensure high quality products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design, build and support infrastructure and security technologies within the cloud that offer resiliency, observability and optimized cost.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate proactively and effectively to different kinds of audiences within the company. Share your own experience, knowledge and expertise with others to help them grow and develop.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in planning work and identify areas of improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform technology evaluation and selection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in an on-call rotation for maintenance of the cloud solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in scalable, distributed systems architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Cloud Platforms, ideally GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with programming using Go (Golang)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes for orchestration and Docker for containerization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and implementing automated service deployments, including provisions for networking, security, reliability, management, reporting, and configuration management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of best practices for deployment automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Git in a team environment (pull requests, branching, push, and pulls)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CS Degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have an advantage if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an in-depth understanding of networking, including routing, naming, security, network performance, and network failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an in-depth understanding of identity and access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with instrumentation and management of automated deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience resolving customer deployment issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked with globally distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand CI/CD processes, and have some experience building CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This role sits in our Platform Engineering team, which delivers features and design work that spans the Ping platform. The team is focused on building Ping&#39;s identity for AI offerings to secure and govern AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Staff Software Engineer who can turn ideas into production capabilities and work well in a fast-paced, collaborative, cross-functional, and global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal applicant will bring strong software development experience, sound technical judgment, creative problem-solving skills, and a passion for research, innovation, and experimentation. They will be excited by work that spans products, services, APIs, models, and user experiences, and by using AI tooling as a practical part of the engineering workflow to accelerate discovery and delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to contribute to features that help customers identify, secure, and govern AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Will&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver IAM (Identity &amp;amp; Access Management) capabilities across the Ping platform encompassing the whole stack from infrastructure and databases through to UI experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and implementation of APIs, models, workflows, orchestration surfaces, and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and prototype solutions in emerging areas, working with senior technical leaders and product teams to turn validated ideas into product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product management, UX, and engineering teams across Ping to refine features and designs to deliver elegant, usable, and scalable outcomes for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in development life cycle activities such as design, coding, testing, rollout, and production support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use modern AI tooling such as Claude Code as part of day-to-day engineering work to accelerate research, code understanding, prototyping, implementation, and documentation while maintaining strong engineering judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly, share knowledge, and support other engineers through design discussions, code reviews, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in a rapidly changing environment, continuously adapting to evolving customer needs, technology trends, and new ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design, build, test, and operate production services using technologies such as Java, JavaScript, Google Cloud, Docker, and Kubernetes, together with the desire to broaden your expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to use AI engineering tools to accelerate research, code understanding, prototyping, implementation, and documentation while applying sound engineering judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building production services, distributed systems, or shared platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing APIs, RESTful services, integration contracts, and data or domain models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning requirements and ambiguous problems into designs, prototypes, and production-ready solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with authentication, authorisation, and identity management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate technical decisions clearly, collaborate across teams and time zones, and support other engineers through feedback and knowledge sharing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Bonus Points If You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, token exchange, policy systems, delegated administration, or identity data modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI agent identity and non-human identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with MCP, agent skills, and other agent integration concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple codebases, teams, or product areas to ship cohesive outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed systems at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as part of an international team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to technical designs and proof of concept work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Sales Engineer, you will work side by side with our sales team on engaging and interactive customer focused meetings, demonstrations, and proof of concepts that articulate the business and technical value a customer will receive from our solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have the opportunity to exercise deep technical and consultative skills while leveraging your soft skills to engage with customers throughout all pre-sales phases of customer engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with customer teams, from C-level executives to developers, rapidly understanding a customer’s technical needs, how it enables their business initiatives, and deliver back an insightful and innovative solution that targets those needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business and technology delivery of various pre-sales activities including; planning/developing/delivering conceptual solution demonstrations and presentations, providing technical/product guidance to customers/partners/team, hands on delivery of proof of concepts, and responding to RfXs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with other team members, Product Management and Product/Platform Engineering and Support in providing the right deep technical expertise for our prospects and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead or assist team members in building out demos of our solutions and platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace the collaborative culture in Ping by helping out other team members no matter which region they are in, ensuring we succeed as a company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guarantee a continuous handover between the teams when navigating between pre- and post-sales phases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as pre-sales lead for prospect opportunities working with other Ping teams and partners and Account Executive to convert the prospect into a customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The travel volume is 20-30%.&amp;nbsp;This will mostly in the UK but may also involve EMEA wide travel occasionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in a solution pre-sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise of working with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM) solutions in or with enterprise organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IAM related protocols and formats such as: OAuth2, OIDC, SAML, SCIM, LDAP, JSON, XML, SQL, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with installation and configuration of one or more IAM technologies from: Ping Identity, Ping, CA, Oracle, IBM, Novell/NetIQ/Microfocus, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience acting as a recognized leader, providing guidance and support for the extended Sales Engineering team, and handling the most complex and difficult sales opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial consultative skills, ability to interface with various levels including architects, developers, managers, CTO and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with a high level of self-direction and/or collaboratively with other teams within Ping Identity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to relate proposed solution technical capabilities back to customer needs in a narrative style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competency with scripting languages (JavaScript, Groovy, etc.), RESTful Web Services and web development frameworks such as Node.JS and &lt;a href=&quot;http://vue.js&quot;&gt;Vue.js&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep product and technical expertise, with the ability to independently run a Proof of Concept to successful completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead a meeting across all different personas e.g. C-Level, Business owners, Architects, and Developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing and delivering technical presentations, workshops, customized demonstrations, and proof of concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General networking concepts and technologies such as: TCP/IP, HTTP/S, routing, load balancers, proxies, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platforms - AWS, GCP, or Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to work in the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO &amp;amp; Holiday Schedule&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Healthcare Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for Education Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Offset (Specific locations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ping is the collective sum of all our individual experiences, backgrounds and influences and we pride ourselves in growing and learning together. We are committed to building an inclusive and diverse environment where everyone’s individuality is respected and everyone has an Identity. In recruiting for new colleagues, we welcome the unique contributions you can bring and encourage you to be your best self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex including sexual orientation and gender identity, national origin, disability, protected Veteran Status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Solutions Engineer, you will be the primary technical resource for our ANZ Accounts team. You will share your product and technical expertise across security and observability use cases, through presentations, product demonstrations, and technical evaluations (Proof Of Values). As the technical expert, you will work with clients to understand their requirements and pain points, then design the right solution for their business needs. During the sales cycle you will guide customers&amp;nbsp; through POVs, demonstrating Sumo Logic’s ability to meet and exceed their requirements and building a positive relationship that will provide continuous value to our customers. Finally, you will have the opportunity to work cross-functionally with our Product Management and Engineering teams to share your knowledge and experiences to ultimately improve our business and our customers’ success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek talent who wants to leverage their technical and people skills to help deliver solutions to clients directly and become a trusted advisor in the process. Above all else, you should be highly self-motivated and extremely curious to learn more Sumo Logic and the vast problems that it can solve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Account Executives / Account Managers to understand customer challenges and mains, and articulate Sumo Logic’s value proposition, vision, and strategy to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically close complex opportunities through advanced competitive knowledge, technical skill, and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and help orchestrate all phases of the sales cycle, including leading technical validations during the Proof of Value phase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be successful working with all levels of an organization, from executives down to individual developers and Site Reliability Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver product and technical demonstrations of the Sumo Logic service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross functionally with Product Management and Engineering to improve the Sumo Logic service based on your experience with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.S. in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field; M.S. in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years as a Solutions Engineer (preferred), Solutions Architect (preferred), Sales Engineer (preferred), Implementation Consultant, Support Engineer, Site Reliability Engineer, or a Software Developer with experience leading projects and/or working with customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands on knowledge of Security related products, technologies, and sources such as IDS/IPS, SIEM/Log Management, Network / Endpoint Security, Threat Detection, Incident Response, MSSP/MDR, Threat Feeds, CASB, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with open source collections (Telegraf, FluentBit, FluentD, Open Telemetry, etc.) (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with leading and running technical validations like Proof of Value (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling and working with pure SaaS solutions in multi-tenant architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Amazon Web Services (AWS), Google Cloud Platform (GCP), Microsoft Azure (certification is preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A broad background and understanding of technical infrastructure (servers, networking devices, storage, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern application architecture (micro-services, containers) understanding and experience working with Kubernetes, Docker, and/or Lambda (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with various monitoring tools like Splunk, Datadog, Elastic, New Relic, etc. (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a dynamic, fast-paced startup environment and experience at a successful startup (preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, as well as business and technical acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sumo Logic, Inc. helps make the digital world secure, fast, and reliable by unifying critical security and operational data through its Intelligent Operations Platform. Built to address the increasing complexity of modern cybersecurity and cloud operations challenges, we empower digital teams to move from reaction to readiness—combining agentic AI-powered SIEM and log analytics into a single platform to detect, investigate, and resolve modern challenges. Customers around the world rely on Sumo Logic for trusted insights to protect against security threats, ensure reliability, and gain powerful insights into their digital environments. For more information, visit www.sumologic.com.&lt;br&gt;Sumo Logic Privacy Policy. Employees will be responsible for complying with applicable federal privacy laws and regulations, as well as organizational policies related to data protection.&lt;br&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ripple is looking for a highly skilled Privacy Senior Manager to join our team. This opportunity empowers you to strengthen, scale, and manage the programmatic and day-to-day activities of our Global Privacy Program. You will be a proven individual contributor, helping us drive our privacy initiatives and elevate our operational standards globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in managing the day-to-day aspects of global privacy operations, including processing data subject requests, improving current processes, updating inventory, and data mapping, and leading privacy impact assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continued development and operationalization of the global program, including updating policy and procedures to ensure compliance with applicable regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about relevant global privacy legislation and lead the implementation of any new requirements that may arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and conduct privacy training to ensure adoption throughout the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain program metrics to proactively identify risks and trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and maintain privacy tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare ad-hoc and quarterly reports, presentation slides, and program material for employees, subsidiaries and senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide operational support to the Regulatory Compliance team in ad-hoc matters related to licensing, operational resilience, outsourcing and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors Degree from an accredited university or college.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-8+ years of privacy program management experience. Preference will be given to candidates with experience in the financial technology or crypto industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience drafting and reviewing privacy related contract terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global privacy initiatives, including understanding of US state privacy laws, EU GDPR, UK data protection regulations, and other international privacy regimes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, organizational and program management skills, with an attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to shifting priorities, work well under pressure, and adhere to deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication (presentation, writing, speaking) and interpersonal skills, including the ability to tailor content to specific audiences and break down complex requirements into actionable requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially-minded team player who embraces uncertainty and excels at solving complex privacy issues within the financial services sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable completing tasks independently in a team environment with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Privacy certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
